  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 400 degrees Fahrenheit.",
    "Heat the olive oil in the cataplana vessel over medium heat.",
    "Add the sliced mushrooms and cook until they release their liquid and start to brown.",
    "Add the chopped spinach and cook until wilted.",
    "Add the diced tomatoes, smoked paprika, and hot sauce, and stir to combine.",
    "Make four wells in the mixture and crack an egg into each well.",
    "Add the flaked smoked cod on top of the eggs.",
    "Drizzle the apricot jam over the cod.",
    "Add the vegetarian sausages to the cataplana vessel.",
    "Transfer the cataplana vessel to the preheated oven and bake for 20 minutes."
  ],
